(text "PASSIVE FLEX: 24 fabricated 6.5 mm skin electrodes + one fabricated 20-contact tail; no purchased parts.\nAll eight B contacts share BIAS_E, driven by the main-board bias amplifier; no skin contact is GND.\nEach electrode is pin 1. GND is reserved for shield/return copper, not a skin electrode." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fef9ff62-ce89-578d-b189-7cf6397b673e"))
(text "TAIL ORIENTATION: exposed tail contacts on B.Cu; PI stiffener on F.Cu (skin side).\nDistal tail U-turns up the distal module wall, entering J1 proximally; maintain pin 1, no axial twist.\nOptional contact build: 2-3 SMD spring pins with 2 mm heads per electrode; not fitted or included in this flex BOM.\nIf spring pins are selected, qualify attachment, travel, skin pressure and finish before assembly." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 219.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8a7711fe-2e57-5374-9f15-49fbdaa7b37f"))
